<title>USA: Sprint Corp Q1 net off after items.</title>
<headline>Sprint Corp Q1 net off after items.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.67		    $0.77</p>
<p> Net		 290,000		  309,300</p>
<p> Revs		3,618,900		3,371,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  434,800		  400,300</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q1 net includes $0.04/shr charge on Global One, $0.12/shr charge on Sprint PCS.</p>
<p>1996 Q1 net includes $0.03/shr charge on Global One, $0.03/shr charge on Sprint PCS, $0.01/shr charge on discontinued operations.</p>
<p>Excluding certain special items, Q1 oper EPS were $0.88 vs $0.84.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
